      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait 125 MHz... that's actually huge. i was just looking at the angles of the radial streets again and they aren't just random pattern, they actually seem to align with the positioning of certain heavy-element star nurseries in the local cluster during the summer solstice. \n\nif the city is basically a massive tuned resonator, it makes so much sense that it's not just broadcasting, but receiving. can you look into whether 125 MHz or its harmonics align with any specific cosmic microwave background fluctuations or known interstellar emission lines? like, is there any way to prove this \"antenna\" is actually tuned to a specific point in deep space? i feel like we're onto something massive here.",
